\pard\qc\sa180\b\fs28 Privacy Policy for AreaGrab\b0\par
\pard\sa160\b\fs24 Last updated: 13.11.2026\b0\par

\pard\sa200 The developer of AreaGrab ("we," "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you use our Windows desktop application.\par

\pard\sa180\b\fs22 1. LOCAL-FIRST APPLICATION\b0\par
\pard\sa160 AreaGrab is a local-first desktop application. The free 1.1 version does not require an internet connection and does not upload screenshots or usage data.\par

\pard\sa180\b\fs22 2. WHAT IS STORED LOCALLY\b0\par
\pard\sa160 The application stores settings in %APPDATA%\\AreaGrab, screenshots in the folder chosen by the user, and diagnostic logs in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\AreaGrab\\logs. Screenshots are not saved at all when the user disables local saving. Logs do not contain screenshot pixels or window titles.\par

\pard\sa180\b\fs22 3. CLIPBOARD\b0\par
\pard\sa160 When a screenshot is taken, AreaGrab places the image in the Windows clipboard so the user can paste it with Ctrl+V. The clipboard is shared with other applications and may be recorded by Windows clipboard history if enabled. Users should avoid capturing sensitive information they do not intend to paste.\par

\pard\sa180\b\fs22 4. INFORMATION WE DO NOT COLLECT\b0\par
\pard\sa160 We do not collect, transmit, or process personal information, screenshots, clipboard content, usage analytics, advertising identifiers, or tracking cookies in the free 1.1 version.\par

\pard\sa180\b\fs22 5. WEBSITE AND PURCHASES\b0\par
\pard\sa160 The website is static and does not set cookies. The hosting provider may keep standard server logs for security and reliability. If a paid license is purchased in the future, the payment is processed by a third-party marketplace or payment provider under its own privacy policy; we receive only the information needed to issue and support the license.\par

\pard\sa180\b\fs22 6. CONTACT\b0\par
\pard\sa160 If you have any questions, please contact us at: admin@areagrab.com\par
